        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "(ii)Offshore nodule collection system: We are working with our strategic partner and investor, Allseas, to complete the development and commission of a system to collect, lift and transport nodules from the seafloor to shore.",
        "start_character": 70029,
        "end_character": 70254
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "(iv)Onshore nodule processing and refining: With the support of engineering firm Hatch and consultants KPM, we have developed a near-zero solid waste flowsheet.",
        "start_character": 76743,
        "end_character": 76903
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Further to the non-binding term sheet entered into in March 2022 with Allseas, we continue discussions with Allseas regarding the scope and timing of vessel upgrades and development (engineering and fabrication) of PV1.",
        "start_character": 72731,
        "end_character": 72950
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "If our nodules are to be processed and refined in the United States, we can also compress the length of current supply chain that some materials need to travel before reaching the United States from 50,000 down to 3,800 nautical miles, while reducing dependency on China which currently dominates refining these critical metals, including through Chinese-owned businesses in jurisdictions like Indonesia and the Democratic Republic of Congo (“DRC”).",
        "start_character": 13404,
        "end_character": 13853
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In March 2026, we signed a Strategic Partnership and Development Agreement.",
        "start_character": 65301,
        "end_character": 65376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to the permitting required under DSHMRA and environmental reviews under NEPA, we will be subject us to a complex regulatory system in the United States which we are in the initial stages of analyzing to determine applicability and how compliance will impact our development plans and potential commercial operations.",
        "start_character": 114603,
        "end_character": 114931
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037863-1ebf9a5769a1c140",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037863",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "On March 19, 2026, we signed a Strategic Partnership Agreement with Mariana focusing on the potential development of a nodule processing and refining facility in the Port of Brownsville, Texas as part of our owner’s team.",
        "start_character": 10047,
        "end_character": 10268
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037863",
