        "statement": "On March 19, 2026, we signed a Strategic Partnership Agreement with Mariana focusing on the potential development of the nodule processing and refining facility in the Port of Brownsville, Texas as part of our owner’s team.",
        "start_character": 101575,
        "end_character": 101798
