        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To reach our objective and initiate commercial production, we are working to: (i) further refine our project economics, (ii) complete the development of and commission a commercial offshore nodule collection system, (iii) continue to assess the environmental, social and cultural impacts of offshore nodule collection, and (iv) secure existing foreign and/or develop new domestic U.S.",
